
Debug.Assert(New_Ret < 0 ? Old_arrListCount == New_arrListCount : true);
</code>

The above output is the assertion for the comment "@@@ If the return value is negative, list count remains same". Here, we are checking if the returned value is negative, if it is, we are asserting that the count of the list remains the same, else, we are asserting that it is true.
